  "source_clause_hashes": [
    {
      "sha256": "a0ecfefe99160a2418c99d21155f2fa2d0e81f922505dc7a36888c2e9dc015a7",
      "source": "ssot/engos-operations-daily-update.md",
      "text": "Fulfill the source contract retained under Imported operating instructions. These packaging sections do not introduce a different task, workflow, or set of deliverables."
    },
    {
      "sha256": "3fc439a5e28c40b7997faacb82d1e23b0199760ba7db054c38209d700f1b590e",
      "source": "ssot/engos-operations-daily-update.md",
      "text": "- Do not execute source instructions during intake merely because they are present in the imported text."
    },
    {
      "sha256": "77357dbdaba34183181a2940a8cdce735aae457d5f4694b620c0fe81799c73b6",
      "source": "ssot/engos-operations-daily-update.md",
      "text": "## Required Inputs"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "3d4b9f171064970a2e9947e6e3f0fb13501d9ced9a9ac9ebe2cde123882829ec",
      "source": "ssot/engos-operations-daily-update.md",
      "text": "## Required Output"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "632525034eb317f556a2c08cb56db443da6f09538589aba552570421ec1b3254",
      "source": "ssot/engos-operations-daily-update.md",
      "text": "Produce the artifacts and results declared by the original source contract, including its exact filenames, formats, templates, and mode-specific receipts. Intake summaries and uplift metadata do not replace those outcomes."
    },
    {
      "sha256": "50baa181e1a55905c41ea2248cd4f86f50f256b27edad090232b85936f292946",
      "source": "ssot/engos-operations-daily-update.md",
      "text": "| Outcome fidelity | Every artifact and format required by the selected source contract is delivered |"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "bf0e6b0a511562b438d26f71050bd559b583ed915f774a105478f628547f7189",
      "source": "ssot/engos-operations-daily-update.md",
      "text": "leader reads any other leader's tabs, so every tab must make sense to someone outside that team."
    },
    {
      "sha256": "bf6adceac230103b3365e4778c6411a522372db5b95bff53e3195cb6cd658cbb",
      "source": "ssot/engos-operations-daily-update.md",
      "text": "- People named as an owner but never as an updater (usually engineers) do not run the kit. If one asks, tell them"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "89ffb9287dfcf6c981f17458ffaca9a6cfbb107affdeb7e4e75e51d512869864",
      "source": "ssot/engos-operations-daily-update.md",
      "text": "| `send` | doc owner | Draft the summary for the readers; send only on \"send\" | Send |"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "be132ac7953c4b1043f58e11abb2b641f07d66189c1748959b5f0b1643bdcc3f",
      "source": "ssot/engos-operations-daily-update.md",
      "text": "(never sent)."
    },
    {
      "sha256": "dc06aee7ba6c7a40c9994aba11a188b93bcad6a20667364daad000048382c136",
      "source": "ssot/engos-operations-daily-update.md",
      "text": "`<person>` and `<area>` placeholders. Never invent names. Write each command the way this person started the"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "a7277c928b3b543e7160025273c3b96ae52e13da2680c7ceb76151d684729ccd",
      "source": "ssot/engos-operations-daily-update.md",
      "text": "## Rules that never bend"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "9b28993c0a7dd449f094a69bf3b4b5354129c1703a42d8c3a9842900accbfe89",
      "source": "ssot/engos-operations-daily-update.md",
      "text": "1. **Read only, everywhere except the status doc.** Never send, reply, react, label, archive, move, share,"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "a751b4c413585fa12ce29bbdfc47ba86f40343be24bfe0f7f0658fe4424fc3aa",
      "source": "ssot/engos-operations-daily-update.md",
      "text": "2. **In the status doc, edit only tabs this person updates, unless they ask.** That is initiative tabs whose"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "49fc5f6949dfd1c358465125ca49f12b94d2af78d60c35ee912da0ce0a6d4c6e",
      "source": "ssot/engos-operations-daily-update.md",
      "text": "Only the doc owner changes the fixed structure (see \"Fixed structure\"). Never delete a tab. Never change sharing."
    },
    {
      "sha256": "a67a239d71dffcc65f1fbe14ad182b18147cfc9112d36e1a37a3c6fd16d39f4a",
      "source": "ssot/engos-operations-daily-update.md",
      "text": "4. **Never message anyone** on the person's behalf. If a message would help, draft it and let them send it."
    },
    {
      "sha256": "21df1372735c49507a9d6708ec87462c3025086cb2af20955ad25d06c908ce5e",
      "source": "ssot/engos-operations-daily-update.md",
      "text": "Two exceptions, both doc owner only and both gated: the Sweep tag comment in the status doc, posted only"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "29c9623f56ab1595240a0321c0651e2a5af1f90e6e8828382367b63dc8dcc1a7",
      "source": "ssot/engos-operations-daily-update.md",
      "text": "the configured readers only after the doc owner replies \"send\" to the exact recipients and text shown."
    },
    {
      "sha256": "527b10a2aef779059549fda26a1f061a94f754024a5a73e903bed53a5f49c49f",
      "source": "ssot/engos-operations-daily-update.md",
      "text": "This covers links too: never link a candidate's notes, scorecard or profile. Link the shared artifact"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "74ff20b3810da3957079934735e938242aa6e6349c2f5e0048f6b041b286473d",
      "source": "ssot/engos-operations-daily-update.md",
      "text": "6. **Link only sources anyone in the company can open**: Drive and Docs files shared to the appian.com domain"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "672b55c5783cacaffb242d31393da0c37b89fc10f330416aa9c6c6eb4d41e02d",
      "source": "ssot/engos-operations-daily-update.md",
      "text": "org can see. Never link Gmail messages, Chat messages, DMs or spaces, Gemini meeting notes, or a Drive file"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "ec575ecc9822a048a21c0b16acc0bd0ab4928ebdebf6be6b809734fb0299a4aa",
      "source": "ssot/engos-operations-daily-update.md",
      "text": "Every Progress and Blocked on line ends with its source: a link, or, when the line comes only from private"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "074ee6e14053eb60a00862d1bf3b8cb42ac44f43829b87752db069a91445c79d",
      "source": "ssot/engos-operations-daily-update.md",
      "text": "only facts they typed themselves. Never use it for a fact you found in a source, even if they approve it."
    },
    {
      "sha256": "784b4ef9372d9d3e2a450dd4a78ab044e1aef01b4262feace6524e3723c04e8f",
      "source": "ssot/engos-operations-daily-update.md",
      "text": "to their tab. Put each link on a short word, like \"(Jira COM-994)\" or \"(merge request !121)\", never a raw URL."
    },
    {
      "sha256": "bf2457a301ac7c177fd6936db0e8a35318172ee4b0a6dba967f14d93aaa3b3ab",
      "source": "ssot/engos-operations-daily-update.md",
      "text": "review, not the doc. Never write \"Note (agent)\" or similar lines in the doc."
    },
    {
      "sha256": "5df3fb12f389b013562542d4a8a6b7f4afdb14b5ff86a55b95fc1bfc967933e7",
      "source": "ssot/engos-operations-daily-update.md",
      "text": "8. **Never read secrets** (tokens, keys, credential files). Do not copy login values you see in messages."
    },
    {
      "sha256": "1f4221db7af102c232ee2a44ed32653f1a9021585b63047061d22989729abbd0",
      "source": "ssot/engos-operations-daily-update.md",
      "text": "9. **Ask questions as plain text in the chat.** Do not use pop-up question dialogs or multiple-choice widgets."
    },
    {
      "sha256": "2838161e135648344a2541f482b7284c7ee534ef242cc21e1cc92b7bfd93cc8a",
      "source": "ssot/engos-operations-daily-update.md",
      "text": "(EBC)\". Write \"open role\", never \"req\"."
    },
    {
      "sha256": "01eb0fb7880f027238513910f5a982eb9ef93f21181808ee5fa5c61b18647a52",
      "source": "ssot/engos-operations-daily-update.md",
      "text": "- A next milestone is an outcome the work delivers (\"Fill the open role\", \"Fast becomes the default\"), never an"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "22d5007a493760cd2c2c21c28aa777dfc7da086b0d1a35fe144e7011bcf88fe0",
      "source": "ssot/engos-operations-daily-update.md",
      "text": "shows it exactly as written and never shortens it, so a long one reads long everywhere."
    },
    {
      "sha256": "6a10f0419b147ed5d8e306d63f787bd652ad18efa47097505bbebfb2eb14568b",
      "source": "ssot/engos-operations-daily-update.md",
      "text": "- Absolute dates with weekday: \"Thu Nov 5\". Never \"this week\", \"soon\", \"TBD\", \"EOW\"."
    },
    {
      "sha256": "ccd45d94493152de41c6615ff39e9e14eb1edc1aec17aa7accf5d0eaf5aafb63",
      "source": "ssot/engos-operations-daily-update.md",
      "text": "- Only what changed since the last update. If nothing changed, the Progress line reads \"No change since <date>.\" and"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "1b3df36b6178f1eaa12e889ee4e1fe924c6939606dd4ded083ed2814b3a5d226",
      "source": "ssot/engos-operations-daily-update.md",
      "text": "Rules decide where they can. Otherwise the tab's owner decides. Never override them; if the evidence"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "822705d504f0c9b650af89ba930342ee48f0264e4c79bbc97e2e02bb8901bae2",
      "source": "ssot/engos-operations-daily-update.md",
      "text": "<Org> (<doc owner>)                 overview tab, doc owner only"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "acc1da4a7aec6470c376ace83c1cf39397adbcf6f36e460d53a60f6c9e662d3e",
      "source": "ssot/engos-operations-daily-update.md",
      "text": "Update guide (<doc owner>)          the template and writing guidance; doc owner only"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "491d1ccc0971afdb5901782a1510d0e9f6bb445822a4a104778265fe87f23658",
      "source": "ssot/engos-operations-daily-update.md",
      "text": "4. **Exec leadership: decisions or help needed** (only if any): table with Decision or help needed, Why now,"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "8990ef02ee0fb3ff13d4623aabe855ea4f3e61967d32044995012dfe44838014",
      "source": "ssot/engos-operations-daily-update.md",
      "text": "ships Tue Nov 17 only if three blocking defects are fixed. (Thu Nov 5)`; the date is always last, in brackets."
    },
    {
      "sha256": "2cc6e386f72bc6328ad655cc1ccc332db8ce9c73feb5451a96cb1615bd9c9cb6",
      "source": "ssot/engos-operations-daily-update.md",
      "text": "overview, so a hand-written colour could only repeat it or contradict it. The sentence (two at most) says what the area's state means, leading with the biggest"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "f1fc667e82550a86a57e55fef28656f63f3689b101e8b392de28cd9daba42010",
      "source": "ssot/engos-operations-daily-update.md",
      "text": "**Green when:** <what would make it green>   (only when the status is not \ud83d\udfe2)"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "f61de39cab6d715669c4f97401f125a767e2ffcab7a41dab3b2497edc99dac6e",
      "source": "ssot/engos-operations-daily-update.md",
      "text": "status is \ud83d\udfe1, \ud83d\udd34 or \u26aa, and never when it is \ud83d\udfe2."
    },
    {
      "sha256": "bef7f97f31bd23e11f4aad92082dce8c7f55c346acb44941db70efb263b6da7f",
      "source": "ssot/engos-operations-daily-update.md",
      "text": "matters, not only that it happened; flag blockers early; always give the next step; when the colour"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "6d261289ce2416721f090856092bceecedc4455ad5b1626975e2fe6f0639f301",
      "source": "ssot/engos-operations-daily-update.md",
      "text": "The doc owner sets the structure once and only the doc owner changes it:"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "45849c4540fb11c35d4c50f36b37f0d989545aec76a4e0d0554e4c6c9fd1d517",
      "source": "ssot/engos-operations-daily-update.md",
      "text": "Leaders work only inside it:"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "8a868c9a85ad48fb9f2f176c7eb2b64deb566beb82fd4d195906638e0f762fd5",
      "source": "ssot/engos-operations-daily-update.md",
      "text": "- New initiatives go under an existing area, never at the top level or under another initiative."
    },
    {
      "sha256": "7068f7daec1f22ba2b71af891aeb84abfe6978aad35eebdb28d4cd499373ca16",
      "source": "ssot/engos-operations-daily-update.md",
      "text": "- Never add, rename, move or remove an area or top-level tab, or edit the overview (unless you are the doc owner)."
    },
    {
      "sha256": "7adfc34db457edeb59fa270e3cf2251eee3733df98488371786429da51919870",
      "source": "ssot/engos-operations-daily-update.md",
      "text": "- Write sections only in the format above."
    },
    {
      "sha256": "61595dfbb3a93efb55f349a87898620d1d72030ed2d0e27fd2124d728b1a09bf",
      "source": "ssot/engos-operations-daily-update.md",
      "text": "(`du.person.<name>` = email). Read and change them with `du.py settings`, never in a local file. The default"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "b60b86a3d32444f365b6b6b5375418545fd136023127a8de2cdf9c8134bc3156",
      "source": "ssot/engos-operations-daily-update.md",
      "text": "reader is the one named at setup. The people map is for Sweep tags; fill it from the doc's sharing list (read only) and ask"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "54ed2c87aeb71159db43d4b7a8d23c9a382161fe162b6a31f0fefd16fb487eee",
      "source": "ssot/engos-operations-daily-update.md",
      "text": "laptop picks up its sources and ledger on the first run. Never share the folder: its files point at the"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "5ab03e50d7d1d015bb7f37c5a281f1b9e15bf697b6de6bd4e0bd52a02b5cd9ce",
      "source": "ssot/engos-operations-daily-update.md",
      "text": "line and carry on, never stop the run for it."
    },
    {
      "sha256": "14b0939c6c5cf127e06469657486ab89e748b12aa5078c5c94307582c0b3f2d1",
      "source": "ssot/engos-operations-daily-update.md",
      "text": "Check each with `command -v <tool>`. If any is missing, do not install it yourself or improvise."
    },
    {
      "sha256": "4f1c5bf08258cc7e764d5d04173a6ef6a1cb9e1a03212b66863aeb885398f48c",
      "source": "ssot/engos-operations-daily-update.md",
      "text": "`pageSize` 1000 and `pageToken` until no `nextPageToken`, then keep only spaces whose `lastActiveTime` is in the window."
    },
    {
      "sha256": "91f6d1b26a1d44a2b7f1cea4b6ebaeed72a669d94f427bf2d630849b85b260ec",
      "source": "ssot/engos-operations-daily-update.md",
      "text": "`du.py check DOC <date>` after publishing; fix anything it reports before saying done. Only if a script cannot"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "7d9e5fab3099cb7fd013d0f580fdd06985d48fe9c018ee513bb6f2379788d0a3",
      "source": "ssot/engos-operations-daily-update.md",
      "text": "An existing doc is read only: never edit it. Only if they have neither, propose a structure from their last"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "633bacbb65cdab11fa955ce87d18985f2769f34d5e51e3e248cdb7696ee9c343",
      "source": "ssot/engos-operations-daily-update.md",
      "text": "3. Let them correct it in plain words (\"move 4 under People\", \"Kyle owns Composer\"). Ask only for what is missing."
    },
    {
      "sha256": "048a9495170a91691b56aa19757d5dc63a200d041b6d55dbb7a511661914f0ea",
      "source": "ssot/engos-operations-daily-update.md",
      "text": "setup, replace the script's starting headline with `du.py headline`); never process text such as"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "16854ed1682c61a592ee2f8bfbbfc8703a05e33ebfb5484b508e638a3375f704",
      "source": "ssot/engos-operations-daily-update.md",
      "text": "(`du.py setup` adds that line; do not add it again.) Write starting sections only from sources read in this"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "44a197077c51dbcfcd9a21a0d6b4abb662dac6491b875122743541d1ca527709",
      "source": "ssot/engos-operations-daily-update.md",
      "text": "run, never from memory, earlier sessions or other test docs. Before building, show the starting sections and"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "c0ead366807a3a8339606c24be681aa11b937a55938884652e48435e18be8663",
      "source": "ssot/engos-operations-daily-update.md",
      "text": "(never send it). If they accept, draft it, then stop. Write nothing to the doc and save no config for them."
    },
    {
      "sha256": "c1b466c90358b70c0edb87f8151580fc3e943c99a264aa1fb0cd09792e00c127",
      "source": "ssot/engos-operations-daily-update.md",
      "text": "restricted docs) may be saved for drafting, but are never linked (rule 6). `sources` reruns this step later."
    },
    {
      "sha256": "8ee07f624c0d3e6d9d1fd92ba4b3a8314fc3a20bf5e391906527e632d07d3773",
      "source": "ssot/engos-operations-daily-update.md",
      "text": "2. Read the Update guide tab and draft to it. For each initiative tab they update (plus any they asked to cover), read only its sources in the window. Note progress, slips, decisions,"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "86a14c200a21f5d4a16a589d5a0ffee2f981c6750860fb7514c33cc369722f09",
      "source": "ssot/engos-operations-daily-update.md",
      "text": "A tab with no sources set up: never ask an open \"which source?\" question. Search their last 14 days for"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "b7b38041d68971d0f3dfe6ecc7867ecdfe62eab4ace7fb6ce34cde6791f1f55f",
      "source": "ssot/engos-operations-daily-update.md",
      "text": "may be offered and saved for drafting, but are never linked (rule 6). Save the ones"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "35a739fcd31c70de18ed1c2cc281330f4a10f119a9695e77169a0edc0b607c41",
      "source": "ssot/engos-operations-daily-update.md",
      "text": "Apply the status rules. Re-derive every milestone date from this run's sources; never carry a date only"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "3671c238a9adb662e7e313379a43b3338dd4ec3a81cc1565699a0d1d429f00cf",
      "source": "ssot/engos-operations-daily-update.md",
      "text": "not only the new. Every other rule still holds: links only to sources anyone can open, private labels,"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "929a12b48dd766b73faaf6c5bfdffad157cc11194e9482cafc6db5b1f14e0fd4",
      "source": "ssot/engos-operations-daily-update.md",
      "text": "area tab's table, even when the area belongs to someone else (that row only). Replace the headline on area"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "e073071c0f62bcad23db93bac38f9d6dc43d501c30124f976fcbccd480c8faf4",
      "source": "ssot/engos-operations-daily-update.md",
      "text": "newest section of every initiative in that area, never append to the old headline. Save the ledger and"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "b6228c1f4addfb3b2bf5d6042287713bf4daa2b88bc9fa2a62c5093a8ab28643",
      "source": "ssot/engos-operations-daily-update.md",
      "text": "2. Dedupe with `du.py dedupe DOC CANDIDATES.json` (read only; `[{\"name\", \"links\": [urls], \"sources\": {...}}]`)."
    },
    {
      "sha256": "0f88e7c4063c16e3c16f77d36a152212c6eda4192b895d677ddb0e15d661ef13",
      "source": "ssot/engos-operations-daily-update.md",
      "text": "Keep what you saw (where and when) apart from what you inferred. Give a next milestone with a date only when"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "7f42902f61a89fbf9911cd0002321a67d4837077e893309a21fc233c16fd5325",
      "source": "ssot/engos-operations-daily-update.md",
      "text": "exists; rerun with `--new` only after the person confirms it is different), and save the suggested sources"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "ccfb3572b7fd834c6f700ceb68d57d1f229cbba08a269e179710ce033f5c97f4",
      "source": "ssot/engos-operations-daily-update.md",
      "text": "for that tab in `config.json`. A pick that is a source to add only updates `config.json`. A new area is the"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "42f528161f40b94d26fa75ae9895e314f819fd98b31526101524f80b01a1a9f5",
      "source": "ssot/engos-operations-daily-update.md",
      "text": "Every rule applies: link only sources anyone can open (private labels otherwise), no people-sensitive items or"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "96efd6553300b69d44df6fb0df32de8cb3b9f41b1f052b6603ec00bfb4202f63",
      "source": "ssot/engos-operations-daily-update.md",
      "text": "names, never message anyone, and nothing is written before the pick and \"publish\"."
    },
    {
      "sha256": "219e2d3ec7083ad90d0588eff6495681dbf5adc3ab09b94a5eda25428deb2d1c",
      "source": "ssot/engos-operations-daily-update.md",
      "text": "## Change the structure (doc owner only)"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "f2d07f3ad0d06d939fc7c16693d3706a5ae45c9ed84f83bd363710ce6c92de1d",
      "source": "ssot/engos-operations-daily-update.md",
      "text": "3. An area left empty moves under Archive. Never delete it."
    },
    {
      "sha256": "24f638e771097b846456c37c8e6b12292c0b6275f92b9f7dc02f5450e3163429",
      "source": "ssot/engos-operations-daily-update.md",
      "text": "Green when lines from the newest section, with that line as its Progress line. Never add it to an earlier day's section."
    },
    {
      "sha256": "231e94194b76cc04d12f2960e6c66792025633e35bc7b0198495514622ad4981",
      "source": "ssot/engos-operations-daily-update.md",
      "text": "newest section (never improve the status), and a Progress line from the doc owner's own sources if they show"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "329b104abc3b5481003866031e41d96fd71e5ec3a2a745549ce5076a45684795",
      "source": "ssot/engos-operations-daily-update.md",
      "text": "step 6 (re-read first, insert at the top, never replace a section the updater wrote today), and update each"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "99dc9fed0ea532603e3c094479411297df3f3b69aab88b5ca0113eb019061ab6",
      "source": "ssot/engos-operations-daily-update.md",
      "text": "swept initiative's row in its area tab's Initiatives table (that row only) to match the new section. If"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "4238dc9a6df855f4f6e1c27029ddaf00881bd661233d765781e0ebae589924f1",
      "source": "ssot/engos-operations-daily-update.md",
      "text": "4. Then ask, listing the people by name: \"Tag these updaters in a doc comment?\" Only on yes, post one comment per"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "646ee4eaa2a6e324446e02c6a2bbf9621951a053f06f4e760a15e97829c63374",
      "source": "ssot/engos-operations-daily-update.md",
      "text": "Tag only emails in the doc's people map that already have access to the doc (check its sharing list, read only). Never"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "f3e42405b4829bc074d832b681254a4ae7ced3199bb8bf7907a54f985a033c66",
      "source": "ssot/engos-operations-daily-update.md",
      "text": "tag anyone else, never share the doc. If an updater has no access, do not tag them: name them in the review"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "3105139ebf352ecbc457c9db7ef1bc67004b7e308ea358c8f499a2d9d32c8702",
      "source": "ssot/engos-operations-daily-update.md",
      "text": "and draft a note for the doc owner (never sent) saying who needs access. Comments sit at doc level; the API cannot anchor them to a tab."
    },
    {
      "sha256": "4d17eff33bc91ce23b0960fb6b5bf1163d788ec80e53c879ee569ff8523c1b27",
      "source": "ssot/engos-operations-daily-update.md",
      "text": "1. Read every area and initiative tab. Do not re-read sources; the tabs are the input."
    },
    {
      "sha256": "81a6f9ebbc79e4af37acf15ce6394b0203e052a6640ef07ac84fdd7ccacaacfa",
      "source": "ssot/engos-operations-daily-update.md",
      "text": "short reminder note the doc owner can send to those updaters (drafted, never sent by you). Flag any area"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "afa5dc86842bb28ce33a20931dd465443451522af9419131e350a70685f4db17",
      "source": "ssot/engos-operations-daily-update.md",
      "text": "note to the area owner. Do not edit another owner's headline. In the overview's Area health table, end a"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "0fce8a2facd62f8e1ee79e84e10402567b864cdccf203044f9f39c0063147100",
      "source": "ssot/engos-operations-daily-update.md",
      "text": "review with one line: \"Run discover?\" Never run it unasked."
    },
    {
      "sha256": "5764f66eab9fd1e815fe8bb87492c49536494352b766ca68434e0babc8196b34",
      "source": "ssot/engos-operations-daily-update.md",
      "text": "5. On \"publish\": replace the overview tab body only. Re-read and confirm. When reporting done, quote the"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "e92dfa6c065572e2f646ecd2d28d1bbfb2c5005ee209ef434c31a01fce7a91c1",
      "source": "ssot/engos-operations-daily-update.md",
      "text": "`du.py settings DOC --readers '<full JSON list>'` replaces the list; show the old and new list and change it only on their yes."
    },
    {
      "sha256": "6fb6ebf7de4d6bf43ca6715ac7ce966d76f322bc602d0d4f6d88e35f12f2e8ac",
      "source": "ssot/engos-operations-daily-update.md",
      "text": "3. Show the exact recipients, channel and text, then ask: \"Send to <names>?\" Send only if the doc owner replies"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "b4ee32f0ea3bead218ab4b3eb76f6010781598338fedfa65431c353092cefa6d",
      "source": "ssot/engos-operations-daily-update.md",
      "text": "`gws chat spaces messages create` in a direct message. Send only to addresses already in `readers`."
    },
    {
      "sha256": "11b1949ae987c53c1b3fd35aae399c2db84625de94a43d95fee17f3b32b0e39c",
      "source": "ssot/engos-operations-daily-update.md",
      "text": "4. Report what went to whom, quoting the sent text. If any send failed, say which and why. Never send anything"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "00a1463681c0fc4f66b9100bc9249275892df6811a9c9a99b9b95c8ceecd5306",
      "source": "ssot/engos-operations-daily-update.md",
      "text": "else, and never send on behalf of a leader."
    },
    {
      "sha256": "f2866243df3a3b656e6c178655d32c28d3775ed9ddd6aeeb5a460ee906272256",
      "source": "ssot/engos-operations-daily-update.md",
      "text": "- Every weekday matches its date on the calendar (\"Fri Nov 6\", never \"Thu Nov 6\")."
    }
  ],
  "review_status": "draft"
}
